---
// BeP02GeneratedDefaults: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2g">
  <div class="bep2g-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 304" role="img" aria-label="Four defaults a code generator picks: one verb for every operation, one status code for every outcome, failures wrapped inside a 200, a list that returns the whole table. They surface later as a retried create that files the same case twice and an uptime dashboard that stays green while every request fails. These are contract bugs, not code bugs.">
<text x="20" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>what the generator picked</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cái generator đã chọn</tspan></text>
<text x="520" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>what you find out later</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cái bạn phát hiện sau</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="40" width="410" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="40" y="67" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>one verb for every operation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một verb cho mọi thao tác</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="98" width="410" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="40" y="125" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>one status code for every outcome</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một status code cho mọi kết quả</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="156" width="410" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="40" y="183" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>failures wrapped politely inside a 200</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lỗi được gói lịch sự trong một 200</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="214" width="410" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="40" y="241" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>a list that returns the whole table</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>danh sách trả về nguyên cả bảng</tspan></text>
<rect x="520" y="40" width="360" height="92" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="540" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>a client retries a create after a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client retry thao tác create sau một cú</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="86" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>flaky timeout and files the same</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>timeout chập chờn và ghi cùng một</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="106" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>case twice</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vụ việc hai lần</tspan></text>
<rect x="520" y="156" width="360" height="92" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="540" y="182" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>the uptime dashboard glows green</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dashboard uptime xanh mướt</tspan></text>
<text x="540" y="202" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>while every request fails quietly</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong khi mọi request đang fail câm lặng</tspan></text>
<path d="M 436 100 L 506.1 87.1" class="lnr" /><polygon points="512,86 504.7,91.3 503.3,83.6" class="hdr" />
<path d="M 436 180 L 506.2 200.3" class="lnr" /><polygon points="512,202 503.1,203.5 505.3,196.0" class="hdr" />
<text x="450" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>not code bugs — contract bugs, and the contract is the one thing the generator never sees</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không phải bug code — là bug hợp đồng, thứ duy nhất generator không bao giờ thấy</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Thirty seconds of generated endpoints, and the four defaults that come with them. None breaks a test; each shows up later as a duplicate case or a dashboard that lies.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ba mươi giây có một bộ endpoint, kèm bốn mặc định đi theo. Không cái nào làm hỏng test; mỗi cái lộ ra sau đó thành một vụ trùng hoặc một dashboard nói dối.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2g-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
